Package: Itemanalysis
Title: Tools for Item-Level Statistical Analysis in Psychometrics
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2025-11-05
Authors@R: 
    person("Cesar", "Merino Soto", email = "sikayax@yahoo.com.ar", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Collection of tools for analyzing items in psychological and educational scales, 
    from a nonparametric approach: similarity of item responses, effect of groups, etc.
